.TH SANCHALA-SPOTLIGHT 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-spotlight \- macOS-style universal search
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-spotlight
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIquery\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fast, intelligent search for applications, files, calculations, and web.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B search \fIquery\fR
Search and display results
.TP
.B open \fIquery\fR
Search and open the first result
.TP
.B gui
Open graphical launcher (KRunner/Rofi)
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Applications
Search installed applications by name
.TP
.B Files
Search files using locate database
.TP
.B Calculator
Evaluate mathematical expressions
.TP
.B Web Search
Quick web search via DuckDuckGo
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Search for Firefox:
.B sanchala-spotlight search firefox
.TP
Calculate:
.B sanchala-spotlight "2+2*3"
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
